1
00:00:00,608 --> 00:00:03,888
(Sheldon:)And now that I think about it,
I stood in front of a case of iPods

2
00:00:04,045 --> 00:00:05,755
(Sheldon:)and I bought a Zune.

3
00:00:09,183 --> 00:00:10,283
(Amy:)What's a Zune?

4
00:00:10,451 --> 00:00:12,091
(Sheldon:)Yeah, exactly.

5
00:00:13,621 --> 00:00:16,791
(Sheldon:)It's an MP3 player
brought to us by the makers of Xbox.

6
00:00:18,126 --> 00:00:20,266
(Amy:)No, what are you doing?
No, pick that back up.

7
00:00:20,428 --> 00:00:22,408
(Amy:)You know it's good.
You did the research.

8
00:00:22,563 --> 00:00:23,903
(Sheldon:)But what if I'm wrong?

9
00:00:24,799 --> 00:00:27,869
(Amy:)You know what?
How about I buy it for you?

10
00:00:28,035 --> 00:00:30,315
(Amy:)How about I buy you both?

11
00:00:31,139 --> 00:00:32,919
(Sheldon:)You know I only have
one slot available

12
00:00:33,074 --> 00:00:34,284
On my entertainment center.

13
00:00:34,442 --> 00:00:36,322
(Amy:)Then I'll buy you
a new entertainment center.

14
00:00:36,477 --> 00:00:39,317
(Sheldon:)Yeah, okay, sure.
But which one?

15
00:00:41,449 --> 00:00:44,829
(Amy:)How about this?
I've heard that if you flip a coin,

16
00:00:44,986 --> 00:00:46,656
(Amy:)it will tell you how
you actually feel.

17
00:00:46,821 --> 00:00:48,231
(Amy:)Because you'll either
be disappointed

18
00:00:48,389 --> 00:00:50,059
(Amy:)or excited by the outcome.

19
00:00:50,224 --> 00:00:51,264
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

20
00:00:51,426 --> 00:00:54,666
(Amy:)So, heads it's PS4,
tails it's Xbox One.

21
00:00:56,164 --> 00:01:02,024
(Sheldon:)All right, I'll try.

